{
    "title": "Toonsutra: Webtoon & Comics",
    "description": "Welcome to Toonsutra, India\u2019s largest comic app! Download now and read world famous stories of romance, mythology, comedy, drama, horror, suspense, thrillers, and more!\r\n\r\nWhether it\u2019s journeying with Bajrangbali in The Legend of Hanuman or fighting on Kurukshetra in 18 Days: The Mahabharat, falling in love with your crush in the hit manhwa The Distance Between Us, saving Mahishmati alongside Baahubali with a special preview of the new animated series Baahubali: Crown of Blood, going berserk with Keanu Reeves in BRZRKR, there\u2019s a story for everybody on Toonsutra!\r\n\r\nFollow superstar storytellers from India and around the world such as S. S. Rajamouli (Baahubali, RRR), Shekhar Kapur (Elizabeth, Mr. India), Ed Brubaker (Captain America, Criminal), Garth Ennis (The Boys), Grant Morrison (Batman), Alicia Souza, John Woo (MI2), Deepak Chopra, Mounica Tata, Rohan Chakravarty, Anjali Patel, and more!\r\n\r\nRegister today to download comics offline, comment, subscribe to your favourite stories, get updates when new episodes drop, and join the comics community! Check-in daily to earn coins and rewards to unlock more stories and comics for FREE!\r\n\r\nConnect with Toonsutra: Your home for stories on our socials!\r\n\r\nInstagram/Threads: @toonsutraofficial\r\n\r\nTwitter/X: @Toonsutra\r\n\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/YSzRw5hXH7\r\n\r\nWebsite: toonsutra.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Toonsutra, India\u2019s largest comic app! Download now and read world famous stories of romance, mythology, comedy, drama, horror, suspense, thrillers, and more!<br><br>Whether it\u2019s journeying with Bajrangbali in The Legend of Hanuman or fighting on Kurukshetra in 18 Days: The Mahabharat, falling in love with your crush in the hit manhwa The Distance Between Us, saving Mahishmati alongside Baahubali with a special preview of the new animated series Baahubali: Crown of Blood, going berserk with Keanu Reeves in BRZRKR, there\u2019s a story for everybody on Toonsutra!<br><br>Follow superstar storytellers from India and around the world such as S. S. Rajamouli (Baahubali, RRR), Shekhar Kapur (Elizabeth, Mr. India), Ed Brubaker (Captain America, Criminal), Garth Ennis (The Boys), Grant Morrison (Batman), Alicia Souza, John Woo (MI2), Deepak Chopra, Mounica Tata, Rohan Chakravarty, Anjali Patel, and more!<br><br>Register today to download comics offline, comment, subscribe to your favourite stories, get updates when new episodes drop, and join the comics community! Check-in daily to earn coins and rewards to unlock more stories and comics for FREE!<br><br>Connect with Toonsutra: Your home for stories on our socials!<br><br>Instagram/Threads: @toonsutraofficial<br><br>Twitter/X: @Toonsutra<br><br>Discord: https://discord.gg/YSzRw5hXH7<br><br>Website: toonsutra.com",
